OL,3,GNEWSANew bus safety laws 'will save
OL,4,Alives' if implemented
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe families of two girls who were
OL,7,Fkilled when they were hit by cars after
OL,8,Fexiting school buses say planned law
OL,9,Fchanges to make school journeys safer
OL,10,F"will save lives".
OL,12,FThe Infrastructure Minister Liz Kimmins
OL,13,Fsaid she plans to introduce laws, which
OL,14,Fif they get executive approval, would
OL,15,Finclude a ban on overtaking buses when
OL,16,Fpeople are getting on or off on 60mph
OL,17,Frural roads.
OL,19,FKimmins hopes to bring the legislative
OL,20,Fproposals to the Assembly this autumn.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
